The run-3 tape exposes the timing gap against the human reference: my policy did not finish its first tier-III sluice until ~441 seconds, while the human had all three income works tiered before beginning the turret buildout. Run 4 will copy that principle—not the exact play—by batching affordable phase actions: three sluices → one stockpile → all sluices tier III → second stockpile → four turrets → all turrets tier III, with only three fresh boss decoys and a repair reserve.
