codex
The sibling tape provides the missing mechanism: its max-tier buildout succeeded because it deliberately used a second `BLAST_AT` during cooldown to force dense observations, not because its economy was intrinsically richer. Its boss phase then failed by switching to continuous blast and placing all three palisades on the far bank. For the final run I’m taking only the proven pre-wave build schedule and observation trigger, while keeping the rig active and repairing a fresh center interceptor; the exact accepted inputs will remain in the tape, while the diagnostic transcript is compacted to avoid another I/O interruption.
